# bench — MurmurBench-0
#
# Data is NOT tracked. Every artifact under data*/ is regenerable from the
# committed scripts, and committing it would let a later run silently differ
# from the audited one. RESULTS.md carries the numbers; the data is rebuilt
# by re-running the pipeline.
data/
data-pairs/
data-arms/
# data-vendor/ holds both regenerable and irreplaceable artifacts. Fetched
# reactions and selection outputs are regenerable and stay ignored; human
# judgement (the answer key, both arms' outputs, the score) is tracked.
# NOTE: git cannot re-include files under an ignored directory, so the
# regenerable subsets are listed explicitly rather than ignoring data-vendor/.
data-vendor/reactions/
data-vendor/pairs.json
data-vendor/v4-announcement.txt
